{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53206","headline":"诗偈 三十一 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 三十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自恨己身痴，有事无人知。\n横展两脚睡，至晓不寻思。\n诸佛爲我爷，我是世尊儿。\n儿今已长大，替父爲导师。\n父子同宅住，寸步不相离。\n法身无相貌，世人那得知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53206.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53206","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}